# Specifications

Design documents and implementation plans for features — in-flight and historical.

## Folder layout

### `active/`

In-progress work. When a spec is complete and shipped, the folder moves atomically to `archive/<YYYY-MM-DD>-<slug>/` with a top-of-file summary of what shipped and what was deferred.

### `archive/`

Shipped or retired specs, preserved as the audit trail. **Frozen** — do not edit archived specs. If a follow-on effort supersedes an archived plan, create a new spec in `active/` and reference the prior archive.

## Naming

- `active/<slug>/` — directory per spec; can contain `PLAN.md`, `DESIGN.md`, `RESUMPTION-NOTES.md`, phase plans, etc.
- `archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>/` — date-prefixed, archived as a unit

